DOOM CE 4.0.0
→ 794.8 → Computer Games

TYPE        community enhancement mod
BASE        PlayStation DOOM + DOOM 64 total conversions
ENGINE      UZDoom 5.0.0+  (build noted: 5.0.1)
PLATFORM    source-port mod for classic Doom family
GOAL        original-game feel + optional modern extras

CORE CHANGE
  player physics overhaul (default ON, menu-toggleable)
  rewritten from reverse-engineered original sources
  covers: movement, friction, gravity, view-bob, knockback

KEY VARIABLES / CVARS
  r_visibility     player light radius now scales with this
  r_dynlights      replaces old gl_lights
  con_stackident   feature presets disable this; menu shortcut added
  secret-found notify cvars  fixed
  prediction checks          added to reduce MP desync

FUNDAMENTALS
  UZDoom = source port with controller support, haptics, packet-server MP
  mod stays modular: upscaled textures, PBR, particles remain optional
  PSX sprite stretch locked at 0.8 regardless of aspect setting
  map-pack addons must be redownloaded; D64 lost-levels PK3 regenerated
  MP stability is preliminary; desync reports requested

WHY IT MATTERS
  engine move + physics rewrite is the real 4.0.0 event
  authenticity first, extras second
  changelog lives on ModDB: /mods/doom-ce/news/doom-ce-400-released
